Around half of all Ho speakers reside in [[West Singhbhum district|West Singhbhum]] district of Jharkhand, where they form a majority. Ho speakers are also found in districts of [[East Singhbhum]] in southern Jharkhand, [[Mayurbhanj]] and [[Keonjhar]] in northern Odisha.

